  82:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****     frequencies.
  83:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****     [..]
